msgstr "+30 PV max et +1 DEF, en permanence."

#: assets/data/combat.json
msgid "+30% crit, and your blades carry a rumor of venom."
msgstr "+30 % de critique, et vos lames portent un soupçon de venin."

#: assets/data/combat.json
msgid "+40% damage against enemies below 30% HP."
msgstr "+40 % de dégâts contre les ennemis sous 30 % de PV."

#: assets/data/combat.json
msgid "+8 DEF, immune to stun and poison, fiercer when bloodied."
msgstr "+8 DEF, insensible à l'étourdissement et au poison, plus féroce une fois en sang."

#: assets/data/combat.json
msgid "+8 HP a rank"
msgstr "+8 PV par rang"

#: assets/data/combat.json
msgid "6% of the damage you deal heals you."
msgstr "6 % des dégâts que vous infligez vous soignent."

#: assets/data/combat.json
msgid "8% of the damage you deal heals you."
msgstr "8 % des dégâts que vous infligez vous soignent."

#: assets/data/combat.json
msgid "A blessed blow."
msgstr "Un coup béni."

#: assets/data/combat.json
msgid "A breath and a roar."
msgstr "Un souffle et un rugissement."

#: assets/data/combat.json
msgid "A creeping rot that poisons for turns."
msgstr "Une pourriture rampante qui empoisonne pendant plusieurs tours."

#: assets/data/combat.json
msgid "A creeping rot."
msgstr "Une pourriture rampante."

#: assets/data/combat.json
msgid "A cruel arrowhead that poisons the wound."
msgstr "Une pointe cruelle qui empoisonne la plaie."

#: assets/data/combat.json
msgid "A crushing blow."
msgstr "Un coup écrasant."

#: assets/data/combat.json
msgid "A forge-demon walks the twenty-first depth with a furnace where its heart should be. Hilda wants the grips off its hands. She says she'll know what to do with them."
msgstr "Un démon-forge arpente la vingt et unième profondeur, un fourneau à la place du cœur. Hilda veut les poignes de ses mains. Elle dit qu'elle saura quoi en faire."

#: assets/data/combat.json
msgid "A fortress that marches. +5 DEF, unstaggerable, stronger when bloodied."
msgstr "Une forteresse en marche. +5 DEF, inébranlable, plus redoutable une fois en sang."

#: assets/data/combat.json
msgid "A grey wolf as big as a pony has taken three sheep from the forest farms, and a shepherd's boot with the shepherd still in it. The old ones call it Greymaw. It howls and the forest answers."
msgstr "Un loup gris grand comme un poney a emporté trois moutons des fermes de la forêt, et une botte de berger avec le berger encore dedans. Les anciens l'appellent Gueule-Grise. Il hurle et la forêt lui répond."

#: assets/data/combat.json
msgid "A hammer of light falls."
msgstr "Un marteau de lumière s'abat."

#: assets/data/combat.json
msgid "A knight in rusted mail walks the drowned road at the bottom of the marsh. He was buried in the bog a hundred years ago and has not noticed. The hands of the bog come up where he points."
msgstr "Un chevalier en cotte de mailles rouillée arpente la route noyée au fond du marais. On l'a enterré dans la tourbière il y a cent ans, et il ne l'a pas remarqué. Les mains de la tourbière surgissent là où il pointe le doigt."

#: assets/data/combat.json
msgid "A lance of pure force."
msgstr "Une lance de force pure."

#: assets/data/combat.json
msgid "A lance of pure force: enormous INT damage."
msgstr "Une lance de force pure : énormes dégâts d'INT."

#: assets/data/combat.json
msgid "A lash of stolen life."
msgstr "Un coup de fouet de vie volée."

#: assets/data/combat.json
msgid "A measured arrow to a weak point."
msgstr "Une flèche ajustée sur un point faible."

#: assets/data/combat.json
msgid "A measured arrow."
msgstr "Une flèche ajustée."

#: assets/data/combat.json
msgid "A pall of rot over every foe in reach, poisoning them."
msgstr "Un voile de pourriture sur tous les ennemis à portée, qui les empoisonne."

#: assets/data/combat.json
msgid "A pall of rot."
msgstr "Un voile de pourriture."

#: assets/data/combat.json
msgid "A piece of the sky."
msgstr "Un morceau du ciel."

#: assets/data/combat.json
msgid "A roar and a wide swing that can stagger."
msgstr "Un rugissement et un large moulinet qui peut faire vaciller."

#: assets/data/combat.json
msgid "A sheath of ice: +2 DEF and +5% move speed."
msgstr "Une gaine de glace : +2 DEF et +5 % de vitesse."

#: assets/data/combat.json
msgid "A shield blow with your full weight: heavy STR damage that may stun."
msgstr "Un coup de bouclier de tout votre poids : lourds dégâts de FOR qui peuvent étourdir."

#: assets/data/combat.json
msgid "A sickness with a name on it."
msgstr "Une maladie qui a déjà son destinataire."

#: assets/data/combat.json
msgid "A staggering bash that can stun for a turn."
msgstr "Un choc qui fait vaciller et peut étourdir un tour."

#: assets/data/combat.json
msgid "A staggering bash."
msgstr "Un choc qui fait vaciller."

#: assets/data/combat.json
msgid "A treasury untouched for centuries. Some of the chests are hungry."
